1. Install the necessary packages by running this command in your terminal:

```
npm install discord.js @discordjs/rest @discordjs/util
```

2. Create a new directory for your bot project and initialize a new Node.js project inside it:

```
mkdir my-discord-bot-project
cd my-discord-bot-project
