This is the content of the second section.

\subsection{Another Subsection Title}
This is the content of the second subsection.

\subsubsection{Another Subsubsection Title}
This is the content of the second subsubsection.

\end{document}
```

The above example uses the `tocloft` package for general customization of the ToC, and the `titletoc` package for finer control over the appearance of ToC entries. You can adjust colors, spaces, and other parameters using these packages to fit your document's style. Note that the sample document uses the `article` class, but this approach can be adapted for other classes as well.

